# NAME: AISupplement
# AUTHOR: UykiZhao
# REPO: https://github.com/UykiZhao/Clash-Party-Override-Rule
# UPDATED: 2026-08-08
# PURPOSE: Static AI domains. Precise fallback for platforms the auto-updated
